D7AFFF][/dim]Keep machine artifact-link mutations out of primary sidecar clones[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]SASE background link maintenance never dirties or commits into the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]sidecar clones nested under a project's primary (human) workspace [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]checkout: rename-repair deletions are committable, every background[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]writer authorizes before mutating with an honest machine origin, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]machine writes land in hidden host-owned sidecar clones that push [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]to the remote, the primary's clones converge via pull-based [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]auto-sync only, and the currently stranded deletions are healed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with a doctor guardrail against recurrence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]machine_link_mutations_off_primary.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-y3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-y3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make removed link indexes committable[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]stage-removed-link-indexes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage-removed-link-indexes: validate deleted per-artifact link-index [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paths by canonical location instead of on-disk content in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]_group_valid_indexes so rename repairs commit their deletions alongside [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]their rewrites, with regression tests proving one clean commit an